== Trivia ==
* The item's name is likely alluding to Isaac being dead, something that is heavily implied through the game's cutscenes and confirmed by Edmund McMillen in a tweet.
* This item is arguably the best in the game due to the fact that it gives any other item.
* Death Certificate's effect could be a reference to developer rooms, which are spaces created by game developers that contain every item in the game for testing.
* Death Certificate used to not limit the amount of items in its rooms which certain effects would interact with. This included the items {{i|Abyss}}, {{i|Void}}, and the pickup {{P|Black Rune}} which used to consume multiple items in a room without forcing Isaac to leave the area which had allowed him to amass a large quantity of locusts/stat upgrades. Another was {{i|Moving Box}} which had allowed an additional 10 items to be taken without forcing Isaac to leave the area.
* {{t|NO!}}, {{i|Sacred Orb}}, and {{C|Tainted Lost}} used to have the ability to change item availability in Death Certificate rooms.
* Rerolling items used to allow Isaac to take every rerolled item without being sent out of the area.

